# Lumenhold Academy — 简体中文 (zh-CN) translation of content/events/expansion_faculty.grim
# Maintained by `node tools/grim.js i18n zh-CN`. Translate the text after "="; keep {tokens}.
# "# en:" shows the English source. [hash] marks the English version a line was translated from;
# lines marked STALE need updating — after fixing the text, delete the [hash] and re-run the tool.


@event thorne_old_rival
# en: An Old Rival
title [357013] = 宿敌老友
# en: A flamboyant old wizard in purple has arrived to settle "a forty-year-old matter" with Professor Thorne. A formal duel needs a second. Thorne looks around the courtyard and, to everyone's astonishment, points at you.
text [067b32] = 一位身着紫袍、浮夸的老巫师来了，要和索恩教授了结“一桩四十年前的旧事”。正式决斗需要一名副手。索恩环顾庭院，然后——令所有人震惊地——指向了你。
# en: Two elderly mages facing each other across a dueling ring at dusk, one stern and grey, one flamboyant in purple, a nervous student holding a towel at the side.
scene [40cb18] = 黄昏，两位年迈的法师在决斗场两端对峙，一位严肃灰白，一位紫袍浮夸，一名紧张的学生拿着毛巾站在一旁。
# en: Stand as his second
opt.left.label [e6354b] = 当他的副手
# en: The duel lasts four seconds. Thorne wins. Then both old men sit on the grass and laugh until they wheeze. You've never seen him laugh. Neither has anyone else.
opt.left.say.1 [f8d733] = 决斗只持续了四秒。索恩赢了。然后两个老头坐在草地上，一直笑到喘不过气。你从没见过他笑。别人也没见过。
# en: Politely decline
opt.right.label [8a601d] = 礼貌地拒绝
# en: "Hm," says Thorne, and asks the caretaker instead. He wins anyway. He does not mention it again, which is somehow worse.
opt.right.say.1 [ddf880] = “嗯，”索恩说，转而请了管理员。他照样赢了。他再也没提起这件事，这不知怎么反而更糟。

@event thorne_roses
# en: The Professor's Roses
title [ce1627] = 教授的玫瑰
# en: At dawn, behind the observatory, you find Professor Thorne on his knees in a tiny walled rose garden, murmuring encouragement to a sickly bush. He sees you. Neither of you breathes.
text [163ce7] = 黎明时分，在天文台后面，你发现索恩教授跪在一个围墙环绕的小玫瑰园里，低声鼓励着一株病恹恹的玫瑰。他看见了你。你们俩都屏住了呼吸。
# en: A severe old professor kneeling in a hidden rose garden at dawn, sleeves rolled up, murmuring encouragement to a single struggling rosebush.
scene [0c6758] = 黎明，一位严厉的老教授跪在隐秘的玫瑰园里，袖子卷起，低声鼓励着一株挣扎求生的玫瑰。
# en: Back away and never speak of it
opt.left.label [225e23] = 悄悄退开，永不提起
# en: You leave. The next day in class he calls on you for the hardest question — and then, very quietly, gives you full marks for a so-so answer.
opt.left.say.1 [f662e1] = 你离开了。第二天上课时，他点你回答最难的问题——然后，非常小声地，给你那个马马虎虎的答案打了满分。
# en: Offer to help with the sick bush
opt.right.label [aa5c3c] = 主动帮忙救那株玫瑰
# en: You know the blight; Maud taught you. Within a month the bush is covered in red roses. Thorne leaves one, without comment, on your desk.
opt.right.say.1 [4837e1] = 你认得这种枯萎病，是莫德教你的。一个月内，那株玫瑰开满了红花。索恩在你桌上留下一朵，什么也没说。
# en: Your remedy does nothing. But Thorne lets you kneel beside him for an hour, saying nothing, which you suspect is a great honour.
opt.right.say.2 [629b27] = 你的药方毫无效果。但索恩让你在他身边跪了一个钟头，一言不发——你猜这是莫大的荣幸。

@event thorne_shaking_hands
# en: Thorne's Hands
title [aad4f1] = 索恩的手
# en: After class you see Thorne's wand slip from fingers that won't stop trembling. He picks it up, slowly. "Age," he says, not looking at you. "It comes for every storm eventually. You'll say nothing."
text [b146e2] = 下课后，你看见索恩的魔杖从一双抖个不停的手指间滑落。他慢慢地把它捡起来。“年纪，”他说，没有看你，“每一场风暴终有平息之时。你什么也不会说。”
# en: An old professor gripping the edge of a lectern with both hands, a dropped wand on the floor, a single student in the doorway.
scene [d913fc] = 一位老教授双手紧抓讲台边缘，一根魔杖掉在地上，门口站着一名学生。
# en: Say nothing, as he asks
opt.left.label [08876a] = 照他说的，什么也不说
# en: You never mention it. But you start arriving early to set up his demonstrations. He notices. He lets you.
opt.left.say.1 [5d89d2] = 你从没提起这件事。但你开始提早到教室帮他布置演示。他注意到了。他默许了。
# en: Tell Sister Amaranth
opt.right.label [3f4d80] = 告诉阿玛兰斯修女
# en: Amaranth's tonic steadies his hands. Thorne is furious with you for a week. Then he stops being furious, and starts, grudgingly, teaching you his hardest spells — "before I can't."
opt.right.say.1 [f813ac] = 阿玛兰斯的药剂让他的手稳了下来。索恩对你大发雷霆了一个星期。然后他不再生气，开始勉为其难地教你他最难的咒语——“趁我还能教。”

@event maud_goat
# en: Bartholomew in the Library
title [07ab64] = 图书馆里的巴塞洛缪
# en: Maud's goat, Bartholomew, has got into the library and is eating the Restricted Section. The librarian is apoplectic. Maud, hurrying in, grabs your arm. "He likes you. Get him out before he eats anything with teeth."
text [ff1025] = 莫德的山羊巴塞洛缪闯进了图书馆，正在吃禁书区。图书管理员气得快中风了。莫德匆匆赶来，一把抓住你的胳膊。“它喜欢你。在它吃下什么长牙的书之前，把它弄出去。”
# en: A shaggy goat standing on a library table chewing a book, an apoplectic librarian below, an old woman in a straw hat hurrying through the stacks.
scene [579e73] = 一只毛蓬蓬的山羊站在图书馆的桌子上嚼书，下面是气急败坏的图书管理员，一位戴草帽的老妇人匆匆穿过书架。
# en: Lure him out with an apple
opt.left.label [89957a] = 用苹果把它引出来
# en: Bartholomew follows the apple, and you, out into the sunlight. He has eaten one-third of "Curses of the Northern Wastes". He seems fine. Mostly.
opt.left.say.1 [2ec444] = 巴塞洛缪跟着苹果——也跟着你——走进了阳光里。它吃掉了三分之一本《北方荒原诅咒大全》。它看起来没事。大体上没事。
# en: Bartholomew eats the apple, then your sleeve, then headbutts you into a shelf. Maud gets him out in the end, laughing.
opt.left.say.2 [cef45a] = 巴塞洛缪吃了苹果，然后吃了你的袖子，然后一头把你顶进了书架。最后是莫德笑着把它弄出去的。
# en: Pick him up and carry him out
opt.right.label [5273c3] = 把它抱起来扛出去
# en: He is heavier than he looks and struggles like a sack of angry cats. You carry him all the way to the paddock. The librarian applauds.
opt.right.say.1 [d608cc] = 它比看上去重，挣扎起来像一麻袋愤怒的猫。你一路把它扛到了围场。图书管理员鼓起了掌。

@event maud_recipe
# en: Maud's Soup
title [913763] = 莫德的汤
# en: "I'm going to teach you my soup," says Maud, rolling up her sleeves. "Cures colds, broken hearts and most curses. Don't write it down. You'll remember it if you need it."
text [dcac02] = “我要教你我的汤，”莫德卷起袖子说，“治感冒、治心碎、治大多数诅咒。别写下来。需要的时候你自然会记得。”
# en: A small cottage kitchen, a black iron pot over the fire, an old woman guiding a student's hand as they stir.
scene [a5474e] = 一间小小的农舍厨房，炉火上架着一口黑铁锅，一位老妇人握着学生的手教他搅拌。
# en: Learn it properly
opt.left.label [9c42bb] = 认真学会它
# en: It takes all afternoon. Some of the ingredients are herbs; some, as far as you can tell, are just stories. You remember every step.
opt.left.say.1 [d6eaaf] = 花了一整个下午。有些材料是草药；有些，在你看来，只是故事。你记住了每一步。
# en: Mostly eat it
opt.right.label [390278] = 主要负责吃
# en: You learn about half of it and eat three bowls. Maud declares that the most important part of the recipe anyway.
opt.right.say.1 [51d561] = 你学会了大约一半，喝了三碗。莫德宣布，这反正是这道菜谱里最重要的部分。

@event maud_old_wand
# en: A Wand From Sixty Years Ago
title [017dae] = 六十年前的魔杖
# en: Maud unwraps something from a faded scarf: a slender silver wand. "Edmund's," she says. "He was the one who didn't come back. He'd have wanted it to go beneath the lake again, with someone who meant to close the door."
text [8bc08b] = 莫德从一条褪色的围巾里解开一样东西：一根纤细的银魔杖。“埃德蒙的，”她说，“他就是那个没回来的人。他会希望它再到湖底去一次，跟着一个真心想关上那扇门的人。”
# en: An old woman unwrapping a slender silver wand from a faded silk scarf, a photograph of three young students on the table beside it.
scene [b81801] = 一位老妇人从一条褪色的丝巾里解出一根纤细的银魔杖，旁边桌上放着一张三个年轻学生的照片。
# en: Accept it
opt.left.label [5003f6] = 接受它
# en: It fits your hand like it was waiting. When you hold it near the lake, it hums the same note as the drowned bell.
opt.left.say.1 [fe42ab] = 它在你手里服帖得好像一直在等你。你把它举到湖边时，它和那口沉没的钟发出同一个音。
# en: Tell her to keep it
opt.right.label [680674] = 请她留着
# en: "Keep it for him," you say. She holds it for a long time. "Sixty years," she says, "and nobody ever said that." She makes tea, and you sit with her until dark.
opt.right.say.1 [da80fd] = “替他留着吧，”你说。她握着它很久很久。“六十年了，”她说，“从来没有人这么说过。”她泡了茶，你陪她坐到天黑。

@event isolde_chess
# en: A Game of Tower Chess
title [b9eeea] = 一局高塔棋
# en: The headmistress keeps a board of crystal towers by her window. "Do you play?" she asks. It is clearly not a question. The pieces are already moving into position by themselves.
text [c9c818] = 院长在窗边放着一副水晶塔棋盘。“你下棋吗？”她问。这显然不是一个问题。棋子已经自己走到了位置上。
# en: A chessboard of carved crystal towers on a small table by a tower window, two players, one candle, the lake silver below.
scene [8c661f] = 塔楼窗边的小桌上放着一副雕刻水晶塔的棋盘，两位棋手，一支蜡烛，窗下的湖泛着银光。
# en: Play to win (Lore)
opt.left.label [0ffb19] = 为赢而下（学识）
# en: You win. She looks at the board for a long moment, then laughs — a short, delighted sound. "Again," she says. "Thursday."
opt.left.say.1 [ad5261] = 你赢了。她盯着棋盘看了很久，然后笑了——短促而开心的一声。“再来，”她说，“星期四。”
# en: She wins in nine moves and spends the next hour showing you exactly why. It is the most useful lesson you've had all year.
opt.left.say.2 [a26db6] = 她九步就赢了，然后花了一个钟头告诉你究竟为什么。这是你一整年里最有用的一课。
# en: Play to learn how she thinks
opt.right.label [51a7ef] = 为了解她的想法而下
# en: You lose, slowly, watching. She sacrifices pieces she seems to love. By the end, you understand a great deal about how the academy is run.
opt.right.say.1 [21753e] = 你输了，输得很慢，一边输一边看。她会牺牲那些她似乎很珍爱的棋子。到最后，你对这所学院是怎么运转的明白了许多。

@event isolde_portrait
# en: The Young Headmistress
title [9f225c] = 年轻的院长
# en: In a forgotten corridor you find a portrait of a laughing girl with a wand stuck behind her ear and ink on her nose. The plaque has been scratched off. The eyes are unmistakably the headmistress's. The portrait winks.
text [2b1741] = 在一条被遗忘的走廊里，你发现了一幅画像：一个笑着的女孩，耳后别着魔杖，鼻尖沾着墨水。铭牌被刮掉了。那双眼睛无疑是院长的。画像眨了眨眼。
# en: A portrait in a forgotten corridor of a laughing young woman in student robes with a wand behind her ear, frame dusty, eyes unmistakably the headmistress's.
scene [b07fba] = 被遗忘的走廊里一幅画像：一位身穿学生长袍、耳后别着魔杖、笑着的年轻女子，画框积满灰尘，眼睛无疑是院长的。
# en: Ask the portrait about her
opt.left.label [38d936] = 向画像打听她
# en: "Detention record of the decade," whispers the portrait. "Set the observatory on fire twice. Best student this castle ever had." It winks again.
opt.left.say.1 [a6720c] = “十年来禁闭记录最多的人，”画像低声说，“把天文台烧了两次。这座城堡有过的最好的学生。”它又眨了眨眼。
# en: Tell the headmistress you found it
opt.right.label [966699] = 告诉院长你发现了它
# en: She is quiet for a moment. "I thought they'd burned it." She almost smiles. "Leave it where it is. Someone should remember her."
opt.right.say.1 [1bb647] = 她沉默了片刻。“我还以为他们把它烧了。”她几乎笑了。“就让它留在那儿吧。总该有人记得她。”

@event isolde_judgement
# en: A Question of Mercy
title [a10d01] = 关于仁慈的问题
# en: The headmistress slides a file across her desk. A second-year stole from the apothecary to pay for a sick mother's medicine. The rules say expulsion. "You're a student," she says. "Tell me what a student thinks is just."
text [050856] = 院长把一份卷宗推过桌面。一个二年级生为了给生病的母亲买药，从药铺偷了东西。按校规应当开除。“你是学生，”她说，“告诉我，学生认为什么才算公正。”
# en: The headmistress at her desk with a single file open, a student seated opposite, rain on the window behind them.
scene [d36bff] = 院长坐在书桌后，面前摊开一份卷宗，一名学生坐在对面，身后的窗上落着雨。
# en: Argue for mercy
opt.left.label [a3a062] = 为仁慈辩护
# en: You argue for an hour. She listens to all of it. The second-year is given a job in the infirmary and a stern lecture. The mother recovers.
opt.left.say.1 [eb948e] = 你辩了一个钟头。她全都听完了。那个二年级生被安排到医务室打工，外加一顿严厉的训诫。那位母亲康复了。
# en: The rules exist for a reason
opt.right.label [194310] = 校规自有其道理
# en: "Yes," she says, "they do." She closes the file. You never learn what she decided, but the second-year is still in class the next week, looking grateful at nobody in particular.
opt.right.say.1 [2c1752] = “是的，”她说，“它有。”她合上卷宗。你始终不知道她最后怎么决定的，但下个星期那个二年级生还在上课，对着不特定的某个人一脸感激。
